From 94151e3cb8471e6f882850781d98cbad31342ac1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scroll Ash Lab <scrollash.lab@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 22:30:35 -1000
Subject: [PATCH] ink_detection: seed CacheStore LRU so cache_max_gb bounds the
 directory (#1586)

CacheStore starts its process-local LRU empty and never scans files left by
an earlier run, so reopening an at-budget cache directory spent a second
full budget on top of the open-time sweep (~2x overshoot). Register the
retained files in the new CacheStore before the first read; warn loudly if
zarr exposes no seedable state.

Credit: diagnosis and prior closed PR #1587 by @flummoxjr (auto-closed for
inactivity).
